id: ops-hq5u
title: Sanitize Node test-runner context before release verification
description: "pm-ops verify-release inherits NODE_TEST_CONTEXT when invoked from node:test. Downstream release:check commands then believe they are recursively running under the parent test runner, skip their test files, and fail or produce misleading results."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-07-31T10:13:36.912Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-31T10:18:56.223Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-31T10:16:08.145Z"
completed_at: "2026-07-31T10:16:08.145Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 35
acceptance_criteria: "A regression test proves NODE_TEST_CONTEXT is absent from spawned release checks; The live pm-csv verify-release workflow executes its downstream tests without the recursive node:test warning"
parent: ops-073p
reporter: "harness:codex"
severity: high
environment: pm-ops 2026.7.29-1 under Node.js 24; real-data acceptance against pm-csv
repro_steps: "Run the opt-in real-data pm-ops acceptance test with PM_OPS_TEST_REPOS including pm-csv; verify-release invokes npm run release:check while NODE_TEST_CONTEXT is present."
resolution: "runSync supports explicit environment unsets and verify-release removes NODE_TEST_CONTEXT before invoking npm. The regression test passes, and pm-csv's complete release:check passed against real local data in 74.9 seconds."
expected_result: Each downstream release check runs in a clean process environment and executes its complete test suite.
actual_result: "Focused regression: 1/1 passed. Live pm-todos scan: 2/2 ready. Live pm-csv verify-release: 1/1 repository passed with no recursive node:test warning."
component: verify-release
regression: true
customer_impact: Repository readiness checks can fail spuriously or omit tests when pm-ops is exercised from a Node test harness.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T10:16:07.702Z","harness:codex",NODE_TEST_CONTEXT is inherited by ordinary child processes; nested node --test treats its presence as recursive execution and skips test discovery. Release orchestration must explicitly remove this parent harness marker.
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  index.ts,project,Release verification process environment
tests[2]{command,path,scope,timeout_seconds}:
  NODE_TEST_CONTEXT=child-v8 node --test --test-name-pattern='verify-release strips NODE_TEST_CONTEXT' test/ops.test.ts,test/ops.test.ts,project,60
  "PM_OPS_TEST_REPOS=../pm-todos:../pm-csv node --test --test-name-pattern='real-data:' test/ops.test.ts",test/ops.test.ts,project,180
close_reason: Release subprocesses now remove NODE_TEST_CONTEXT; focused regression and live pm-csv release verification both pass.
body: ""
